<title>USA: Europa Cruises sued by shareholder.</title>
<headline>Europa Cruises sued by shareholder.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A shareholder of Europa Cruises Corp Friday said she started a legal action in Delaware Chancery Court seeking to force the company to hold a stockholders meeting.</p>
<p>In a statement, the shareholder, Dana Catalano, said the company has not held a stockholders meeting since November 1994.</p>
<p>Europa officials were not available for comment.</p>
<p>Catalano could not be reached for further details.</p>
</text>
